abstract: >-
  Fixed-component ERA-GEE for multivariate longitudinal outcomes, combined with
  model-based recursive partitioning, together with the synthetic-data
  validation suite for the method. All validation runs without access to the
  empirical (CLSA) data.
keywords:
  - model-based recursive partitioning
  - generalized estimating equations
  - extended redundancy analysis
  - longitudinal data
  - subgroup heterogeneity
